flowchart TD
  A([Delete key]) --> B{Current node null?}
  B -->|Yes| C[No change]
  B -->|No| D{Compare target and node}
  D -->|Smaller| E[Search left subtree]
  D -->|Larger| F[Search right subtree]
  D -->|Equal| G{Number of children}
  G -->|Zero| H[Delete leaf and return null]
  G -->|One| I[Delete node and return child]
  G -->|Two| J[Copy in-order successor key]
  J --> K[Delete successor from right subtree]
  E --> L([Return updated subtree])
  F --> L
  H --> L
  I --> L
  K --> L
  C --> L
